claim.claim-text:
a base having a top surface and a bottom surface, the top surface configured to support a plurality of electrical components, the bottom surface configured to engage a surface upon which the digital pathology apparatus is supported;
a housing having a plurality of sides and a top, the housing configured to engage the base and cover the plurality of electrical components in a closed position, wherein the housing has an interior surface and an exterior surface and at least one side of the housing comprises one or more openings; and
an electromagnetic shielding material applied to only a portion of the interior surface of the housing.
